'''''Elatine alsinastrum''''' is a member of the genus ''[[Elatine]]'' in the plant family [[Elatinaceae]], the waterwort family.<ref>{{Cite journal |last1=Popiela |first1=Agnieszka |last2=Łysko |first2=Andrzej |last3=Molnár |first3=Attila |date=2013-10-01 |title=Recent distribution of the Euro-Siberian-sub- Mediterranean species Elatine alsinastrum L. (Elatinaceae) |url=https://doi.org/10.2478/v10184-012-0022-8 |journal=Acta Botanica Croatica |volume=72 |issue=2 |pages=375–386 |doi=10.2478/v10184-012-0022-8 |s2cid=86087733 |issn=0365-0588|doi-access=free }}</ref>

==Distribution and habitat==
It is found in Europe and is considered endangered. Populations have also been found in Turkey's [[Çanakkale Province]].<ref>{{Cite journal |last1=Löki |first1=Viktor |last2=Molnár V. |first2=Attila |date=2015 |title=NEW LOCALITIES OF ELATINE MACROPODA AND E. ALSINASTRUM IN TURKEY (ÇANAKKALE) |url=http://real.mtak.hu/25769/ |journal=Studia Botanica Hungarica |language=en |volume=46 |issue=1 |pages=43–47 |doi=10.17110/StudBot.2015.46.1.43 |issn=0301-7001}}</ref>

